message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below."
title: "Great Lakes Potential Longshore Sediment Transport Atlas"
authors:
  - family-names: Sahvelet
    given-names: Muhammed
    email: muhammedsahvelet@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Purdue University"
type: dataset
version: "0.1.0-draft"
date-released: 2026-08-02
url: "https://mnsahvelet.github.io/great-lakes-transport-atlas/"
abstract: >
  Interactive shoreline-scale visualization of potential longshore sediment
  transport for the five Laurentian Great Lakes, computed using the van Rijn
  (2014) transport formulation from WIS wave hindcast data. Accompanies a
  manuscript in preparation.
keywords:
  - Great Lakes
  - longshore sediment transport
  - coastal engineering
  - wave climate
  - van Rijn
